@startuml CU-27
actor "Admin / Encargado" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (Admin/Inventario)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /inventory" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» InventoryService / Inventory, InventoryMovement" as Model
database "«DB» PostgreSQL (Neon)" as DB

Adm -> UI : 1: Accede a "Gestión de Existencias"
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /api/v1/inventory?branch_id=1&variant_id=5
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list(db, branch_id, variant_id)
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT Inventory WHERE branch_id = ?
Model --> Ctrl : 5: list[InventoryRead] {branch_id, variant_id, qty, reserved, available}
Ctrl --> UI : 6: list[InventoryRead]
UI --> Adm : 7: Tabla existencias (cantidad, reservado, disponible)

Adm -> UI : 1: Ajusta stock (corrección/merma)
UI -> Ctrl : 2: PATCH /inventory/{branch_id}/{variant_id}/adjust {qty_change, reason}
Ctrl -> Model : 3: adjust(db, branch_id, variant_id, qty_change, reason)
Model -> Model : 4: Valida resultado >= 0
Model -> DB : 5: UPDATE Inventory SET quantity = quantity + ?
Model -> DB : 6: INSERT InventoryMovement (type=ADJUSTMENT, qty_change, reason)
Model --> Ctrl : 7: InventoryRead actualizado
Ctrl --> UI : 8: InventoryRead
UI --> Adm : 9: Stock actualizado + movimiento

Adm -> UI : 1: Consulta historial movimientos
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /api/v1/inventory/movements?branch_id=1&variant_id=5
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list_movements(db, branch_id, variant_id)
Model -> DB : 4: SELECT InventoryMovement ORDER BY created_at DESC
Model --> Ctrl : 5: list[InventoryMovementRead]
Ctrl --> UI : 6: list[InventoryMovementRead]
UI --> Adm : 7: Historial (tipo, cantidad, motivo, fecha, usuario)

@enduml